CyphtWebmailContactsIncludeUsersHelp = Adds the people who have an account here to the webmail address book, so staff can find each other without every colleague having to exist as a contact.
CyphtWebmailContactsMaxHelp = Upper bound on how many contacts the webmail loads at once. Raise it only if your address book is genuinely larger, because the whole list is fetched each time the cache expires.
CyphtWebmailContextRowsHelp = How many records of each kind (proposals, orders, invoices, tickets, projects) are listed under the sender. Beyond this only the count is shown.

CyphtWebmailContextBlocks = Record types shown
CyphtWebmailContextBlocksHelp = Which kinds of record are listed under the sender. A kind whose module is off, or that the reader has no permission for, stays hidden whatever is ticked here.
