CyphtWebmailInvoicesOpen = All validated

CyphtWebmailInterfaceSettings = Interface
CyphtWebmailLangMode = Language
CyphtWebmailLangModeHelp = The first applies each user's own account language to the webmail when they sign in. The second leaves the webmail's own language setting alone. A language the webmail has no translation for falls back to the default.
CyphtWebmailLangFollow = Same as their account
CyphtWebmailLangUser = Chosen in the webmail

CyphtWebmailThemeMode = Light or dark
CyphtWebmailThemeModeHelp = The webmail is embedded in the page around it, so a light webmail inside a dark page looks broken. Matching follows the same dark mode setting the surrounding page uses, and applies it on each sign-in, which means a theme picked inside the webmail will not stick.
CyphtWebmailThemeFollow = Match the page around it
CyphtWebmailThemeUser = Chosen in the webmail

